# V2 VERNACULAR (THIN)

Doctrina: Smallest Diff. Cero slop.

## HARD BANS
- No `any`. Prefer `type` over `interface` unless extending.
- Named exports only. No default exports.
- Early-return only. Nesting >2 levels banned.
- Infer loading from data. No redundant `isLoading` when data starts null.
- Hooks Bash: max 80 LOC; `set -euo pipefail`; `jq`; fail-closed. No Python/Node/`cd`/`updated_input`.
- Markdown system files max 80 LOC. HANDOFF: TAREA / ARCHIVOS / ESTADO / SIGUIENTE.
- JSON: no comments; atomic policy files; camelCase hook keys.
- State: overwrite only; clear on stop success.
- Chat: `INTENT:` + `Done-when:` before write tools.

## PROCEDURE
Stack style guides (TS/React, Bash templates, Obsidian paths):
**Read `~/.cursor/skills/vernacular/SKILL.md`** before writing matched files.
